  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`storyCard` renders the issue title, asked text, verdict, Story criteria, test cases table, changed prompts and `ask-code` next-step footer, and fails with `invalid_story_card_input` when `root` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`storyFingerprint` computes the Story SHA-256 and the canonical decision SHA-256 of test `{criteria, cases}`, and fails with `invalid_story_fingerprint_input` when `root` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "`fingerprintChanges` reports criterion additions/removals and test case expected-value changes, and fails with `invalid_fingerprint_input` when a row path is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "`fullCheckPass` reconciles `batch.json` and `summary.json` against `preflight.findTests` and `preflight.captureSource`, returning `pass: true` when all discovered tests and changed prompts match a passing snapshot, and fails with `invalid_full_check_input` when `root` or `stateDir` is empty."
    }
  ],
